            <div xml:id="d729">

                <pb facs="0824" n="739" xml:id="pg739"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">823.00/326: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Peru</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Smith</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lima</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-10-14T10:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 14,
                                1919, 10 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received 7.40
                            p.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>President inaugurated October 12th without incident. He held reception 13th. No
                    changes as yet in Cabinet except Minister of Marine recently created by law.</p>
                <p>No newspapers except sheet bulletin foreign news. Strikes apparently ended owing
                    to Government decree issued Saturday compelling arbitration.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Smith</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
